      <activity id="52877758-ed7b-53a7-b5fd-318e41965b13" activityNameId="0c740589-36d6-572f-8b54-60f9cf35de3e" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xxx Industrial residue wood, wood wool production, softwood, u=20%, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Industrial residue wood, wood wool production, softwood, u=20%, at plant
Covers high quality wood wool without shives. The multi-output process "wood wool production, u=20%" delivers the two coproducts "wood wool, u=20%, at plant" and "industrial residue wood, wood wool production, softwood, u=20%, at plant". Allocation is based on the over-all proceeds of the process.;
UUID: 8e0efb3a-fa1b-3f9a-bfc2-5a3a224a672b
Includes all processes of wood wool production from industrial softwood (debarked), including air drying (from u=70 - 20%), external and internal transports, sucktion, air compression, sawmill production
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Medium enterprise technology (2000)
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: personal communication 
Extrapolations: see Geography and Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: The assumption that the technology is representative for central Europe is considered in the uncertainties.
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_8e0efb3a-fa1b-3f9a-bfc2-5a3a224a672b.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
